      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "A table showing four different common program header types.",
      "source_hash": 17234131731952816485,
      "context_hash": 16025148806516312141,
      "translation": "네 가지 일반적인 프로그램 헤더 타입을 보여주는 표입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:54:15.561453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:1",
      "source": "Type 1, PT_LOAD: data to be loaded into memory.",
      "source_hash": 12950137140837111369,
      "context_hash": 5711753003457163910,
      "translation": "타입 1, PT_LOAD: 메모리에 로드될 데이터입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:54:15.561453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:2",
      "source": "Type 2, PT_NOTE: freeform text like copyright notices, version info, etc..",
      "source_hash": 1195482490079061311,
      "context_hash": 4148606971563818177,
      "translation": "타입 2, PT_NOTE: 저작권 표시, 버전 정보 등과 같은 자유 형식 텍스트입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:54:15.561453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:3",
      "source": "Type 3, PT_DYNAMIC: Info about dynamic linking.",
      "source_hash": 3313466976729599370,
      "context_hash": 3545575819807031562,
      "translation": "타입 3, PT_DYNAMIC: 동적 링킹에 대한 정보입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:54:15.561453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:4",
      "source": "Type 4, PT_INTERP: Path to the location of an \"ELF interpreter.\"",
